   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Clear Aligner Treatment for a Straighter, Healthier Smile",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Invisalign® clear aligners offer a modern, discreet way to straighten teeth without metal brackets or wires. At Mason Park Dental of Katy, Dr. William Sung, DMD, provides personalized Invisalign® treatment designed to gently and effectively align teeth while fitting seamlessly into your lifestyle.",
   "html": "<p>Invisalign® clear aligners offer a modern, discreet way to straighten teeth without metal brackets or wires. At <b>Mason Park Dental of Katy</b>, Dr. <b>William Sung, DMD</b>, provides personalized Invisalign® treatment designed to gently and effectively align teeth while fitting seamlessly into your lifestyle.</p>",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Clear aligners are removable, comfortable, and nearly invisible—making them an excellent option for teens and adults seeking a confident smile in Katy, TX.",
   "html": "<p>Clear aligners are removable, comfortable, and nearly invisible—making them an excellent option for teens and adults seeking a confident smile in <b>Katy, TX</b>.</p>",
   "section": 3
  },
