   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Clear Aligner Basics",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "What is Invisalign® treatment?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2131\"><p><a href=\"/services/invisalign/\">Invisalign®</a> is a teeth-straightening system that uses a series of clear, removable aligners to gradually move teeth into proper alignment. Each aligner is custom-made for precision and comfort.</p></div>",
   "text": "What is Invisalign® treatment?",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "How does Invisalign® work?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2132\"><p>Aligners apply gentle, controlled pressure to shift teeth over time. You’ll switch to a new set periodically as your smile improves.</p></div>",
   "text": "How does Invisalign® work?",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Does Invisalign® look natural?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2133\"><p>Yes. Invisalign® aligners are virtually invisible, allowing you to straighten your teeth discreetly.</p></div>",
   "text": "Does Invisalign® look natural?",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Safety & Effectiveness",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Is Invisalign® safe?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1521\"><p>Yes. Invisalign® aligners are made from BPA-free, medical-grade material and are safe for daily use.</p></div>",
   "text": "Is Invisalign® safe?",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Does Invisalign® really work?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1522\"><p>Yes. Invisalign® effectively treats crowding, spacing, and bite-related concerns when worn as instructed.</p></div>",
   "text": "Does Invisalign® really work?",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Is Invisalign® effective for adults and teens?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1523\"><p>Yes. Invisalign® is suitable for both teens and adults with mild to moderate alignment concerns.</p></div>",
   "text": "Is Invisalign® effective for adults and teens?",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Comfort & Daily Life",
   "section": 7
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Is Invisalign® painful?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1551\"><p>Some mild pressure may occur when switching aligners, but discomfort is temporary and minimal.</p></div>",
   "text": "Is Invisalign® painful?",
   "section": 7
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Can I eat and drink with Invisalign®?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1552\"><p>Aligners should be removed before eating or drinking anything other than water, allowing you to enjoy your favorite foods.</p></div>",
   "text": "Can I eat and drink with Invisalign®?",
   "section": 7
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Can I brush and floss normally?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1553\"><p>Yes. Invisalign® aligners are removable, making daily oral hygiene simple and effective.</p></div>",
   "text": "Can I brush and floss normally?",
   "section": 7
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Treatment Timeline",
   "section": 8
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "How long does Invisalign® treatment take?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1681\"><p>Treatment length varies based on individual needs. Some patients see results in a few months, while others require longer treatment.</p></div>",
   "text": "How long does Invisalign® treatment take?",
   "section": 8
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "How often are dental visits needed?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1682\"><p>Visits are usually scheduled every few weeks to monitor progress and provide new aligners.</p></div>",
   "text": "How often are dental visits needed?",
   "section": 8
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Can Invisalign® offer faster results than braces?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1683\"><p>In many cases, Invisalign® can provide results in less time compared to traditional metal braces.</p></div>",
   "text": "Can Invisalign® offer faster results than braces?",
   "section": 8
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Candidacy & Age",
   "section": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Who is a good candidate for Invisalign®?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2601\"><p>Teens and adults with mild to moderate spacing, crowding, or bite concerns are typically good candidates.</p></div>",
   "text": "Who is a good candidate for Invisalign®?",
   "section": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Is Invisalign® suitable for teenagers?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2602\"><p>Yes. Invisalign® is a popular option for teens due to its comfort, appearance, and flexibility.</p></div>",
   "text": "Is Invisalign® suitable for teenagers?",
   "section": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Can adults straighten their teeth with Invisalign®?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2603\"><p>Absolutely. Invisalign® is an excellent choice for adults of all ages.</p></div>",
   "text": "Can adults straighten their teeth with Invisalign®?",
   "section": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Insurance & Financing",
   "section": 10
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Does dental insurance cover Invisalign®?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2611\"><p>Many dental insurance plans include benefits that apply to <a href=\"/services/invisalign/\">Invisalign® treatment</a>. Our team can help verify your coverage.</p></div>",
   "text": "Does dental insurance cover Invisalign®?",
   "section": 10
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Are payment plans available?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2612\"><p>Yes. We offer flexible financing options to help make Invisalign® treatment accessible.</p></div>",
   "text": "Are payment plans available?",
   "section": 10
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Will I know my treatment cost before starting?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2613\"><p>Yes. A detailed treatment plan and cost breakdown are provided before treatment begins.</p></div>",
   "text": "Will I know my treatment cost before starting?",
   "section": 10
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Results & Maintenance",
   "section": 11
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Will I need a retainer after Invisalign®?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1911\"><p>Yes. Retainers are essential to maintain your results and prevent teeth from shifting.</p></div>",
   "text": "Will I need a retainer after Invisalign®?",
   "section": 11
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Can teeth move after treatment?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1912\"><p>Without proper retention, teeth can shift over time. Wearing your retainer helps preserve your smile.</p></div>",
   "text": "Can teeth move after treatment?",
   "section": 11
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "How long will Invisalign® results last?",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1913\"><p>With consistent retainer use and good oral hygiene, results can last long term.</p></div>",
   "text": "How long will Invisalign® results last?",
   "section": 11
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Final Word",
   "section": 12
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Invisalign® clear aligners provide a comfortable, discreet, and effective way to achieve a straighter smile. At Mason Park Dental of Katy, we are committed to delivering personalized care using advanced technology to help you achieve lasting results.",
   "html": "<p>Invisalign® clear aligners provide a comfortable, discreet, and effective way to achieve a straighter smile. At <b>Mason Park Dental of Katy</b>, we are committed to delivering personalized care using advanced technology to help you achieve lasting results.</p>",
